will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#5615\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\nFrom what I've seen, it is recommended to use the RandomNumberGenerator object. However, according to godotengine/godot-proposals#5615, it doesn't allow some functions such as ``Array.shuffle()`` (this is a 3 year old PR, things may have changed, but from my searching I couldn't find any easy alternative).\r\n\r\nBasically, I fell down the generic coder thing of _I could spend 5 minutes implementing a basic custom random number generator global system ORRR spend way longer making a change to THE ENTIRE GAME ENGINE_ :upside_down_face: \r\n\r\nTested on Fedora KDE\r\n\r\nFinally, AI note: This is such a basic system that yeah, of course I didn't use AI to code this! However, I barely know C++ so I asked ChatGPT basic questions such as if I needed to add things to header files, if I am using the right data types, etc. Additionally, I asked if I was missing anything (for example, while I wrote the docs, I only did so because it told me I should). TL;DR: I have social anxiety so I just wanted it to proofread/check everything before I created this PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancem